"经验和进度怎么算": "How XP and progress work",
"。经验药水生效期间，所有经验乘以 2 或 3。每升一级所需经验比上一级多 40。": ". While an XP potion is active, all XP is multiplied by 2 or 3. Each level needs 40 more XP than the one before.",
"记忆等级（艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线）：第一次答对是 1 级；之后隔够遗忘周期再答对才升一级——1 级隔 1 天、2 级隔 2 天、3 级隔 4 天、4 级隔 7 天、5 级隔 15 天，6 级是长期记忆，每 30 天巩固一次。没到时间答对只算练习，答错退两级。": "Memory levels (Ebbinghaus forgetting curve): your first correct answer is level 1; after that you only level up by answering correctly once the review interval has passed: 1 day at level 1, 2 days at level 2, 4 days at level 3, 7 days at level 4, 15 days at level 5; level 6 is long-term memory, consolidated every 30 days. Correct answers before the interval only count as practice; a wrong answer drops you two levels.",
"学习进度 = 标签下所有题的记忆等级之和 ÷（题数 × 6）。全部题都到 6 级就是 100%。": "Progress = sum of the memory levels of all questions under a tag ÷ (number of questions × 6). When every question reaches level 6, that's 100%.",
