"账号与同步": "Account & sync",
"这个页面在 Claude 里打开：做题记录保存在你的 Claude 账号里，换设备登录同一个 Claude 账号就能看到，不需要另外登录。": "This page is open in Claude: your practice history is saved to your Claude account. Sign in to the same Claude account on another device to see it; no separate login needed.",
