"游戏模式": "Game mode",
"打开后：答对得金币、连对 combo 计数、每日任务、商店和道具（经验药水、补签卡）。关掉后这些都不显示，关掉期间答对也不得金币；已有的金币和道具会保留，重新打开还在。经验、等级、今日计划和闯关不受影响。这个开关跟着账号同步。": "When on: coins for correct answers, streak combo counter, daily quests, shop and items (XP potions, repair cards). When off, none of these are shown and correct answers earn no coins; your existing coins and items are kept and come back when you turn it on again. XP, levels, Today's plan and Word levels aren't affected. This setting syncs with your account.",
