"用邮箱登录后，在手机、iPad、电脑上登录同一个邮箱，做题记录会自动同步。不登录也能照常做题，记录只存在这台设备上。": "Sign in with your email, then sign in with the same email on your phone, iPad or computer, and your practice history syncs automatically. You can practice as usual without signing in; your history is then stored only on this device.",
