"登录后会在云端（Supabase）保存：你的邮箱，以及做题、背单词、金币和道具的记录。这些数据只用来在你自己的设备之间同步，别人看不到，也不会用于其他用途。": "When you sign in, the cloud (Supabase) stores your email and your records of practice, vocabulary, coins and items. This data is only used to sync between your own devices; no one else can see it, and it isn't used for anything else.",
