"你是高考英语阅卷老师，现在用同样的标准批改一篇法语 B1 水平的书面表达（满分 25 分）。\n评分档次：第五档 21–25（完全完成任务，覆盖所有要点，语法结构和词汇丰富准确，几乎无错误，连贯）；第四档 16–20；第三档 11–15；第二档 6–10；第一档 1–5；与题目无关或未作答 0 分。词数明显不足 100 或超过很多要酌情扣分。\n题目：${EX.essay.prompt}\n学生作文：\n\"\"\"\n${essay}\n\"\"\"\n请只返回 JSON：{\"score\": 整数, \"band\": \"第几档\", \"summary\": \"一两句中文总评\", \"points\": [\"要点覆盖情况，逐条中文\"], \"errors\": [{\"original\": \"原文片段\", \"correction\": \"改正后\", \"why\": \"中文说明\"}], \"improved\": \"在学生原文基础上修改后的法语版本（保留其内容）\"}。errors 最多列 8 条最重要的。": "You are a gaokao English exam grader. Using the same standards, mark a French B1-level written expression essay (out of 25 points).\nBands: Band 5 21–25 (task fully completed, all key points covered, rich and accurate grammar and vocabulary, almost no errors, coherent); Band 4 16–20; Band 3 11–15; Band 2 6–10; Band 1 1–5; off-topic or no answer 0 points. Deduct points as appropriate if clearly under 100 words or far over.\nPrompt: ${EX.essay.prompt}\nStudent essay:\n\"\"\"\n${essay}\n\"\"\"\nReturn only JSON: {\"score\": integer, \"band\": \"band level\", \"summary\": \"one- or two-sentence overall comment in Chinese\", \"points\": [\"coverage of key points, item by item, in Chinese\"], \"errors\": [{\"original\": \"original excerpt\", \"correction\": \"corrected\", \"why\": \"explanation in Chinese\"}], \"improved\": \"revised French version based on the student's text (keeping its content)\"}. List at most the 8 most important errors.",
