"手机上全屏背单词时，选项和“下一题”挪到屏幕下半部分，拇指更好点；题目和解析在上方，答完选项依然不动。": "In full-screen vocabulary practice on phones, the options and \"Next\" button sit in the lower half of the screen for easier thumb reach; the question and explanation stay on top, and the options still don't move after you answer.",
"手机上全屏做语法题（和听力题）时，选项也挪到屏幕下半部分；解析区固定高度，答完选项不动，解析长了在框里滚动。": "In full-screen grammar (and listening) questions on phones, the options now also sit in the lower half of the screen; the explanation box has a fixed height (long explanations scroll inside it), so the options don't move after you answer.",
"巴黎塔尖换上新美术：地图图标、怪物和 Boss 改成扁平风（普通怪和精英是同一种怪的普通版和强化版），每一层地图边角加了配套装饰，22 个事件都有了自己的插图，铺在事件页的背景里。": "Paris Spire has new art: map icons, monsters and bosses are now flat-style (regular and elite enemies are the normal and powered-up versions of the same creature), each floor's map has matching corner decorations, and all 22 events have their own illustration as the event page background.",
"巴黎塔尖的 22 张事件插图全部重画：每个事件一幅不同的小场景（塞纳河岸、地铁站台、卢浮宫、蒙马特、香榭丽舍、塔顶夜景……），主体更大，有前后层次和不同时间的光线。": "All 22 Paris Spire event illustrations have been redrawn: each event now has its own little scene (the Seine banks, a metro platform, the Louvre, Montmartre, the Champs-Élysées, the tower at night…), with bigger subjects, depth and different times of day.",
"马鞭草茶": "Verbena tea",
"Boss 战里显示当前这道题考的语法点和变位时态（B1 及以上难度才用得上）。": "In a boss fight, reveals the grammar point and tense tested by the current question (only useful from B1 difficulty up).",
"只能在 Boss 战答题时用": "Can only be used while answering in a boss fight",
"这个难度本来就显示考点": "Test points are already shown at this difficulty",
"这道题的考点已经显示了": "This question's test points are already shown",
"巴黎塔尖修复与调整：Boss 题上方的考点标签（语法 · …、变位 · …）只在 A1、A2 难度显示，B1 起隐藏，新增药水“马鞭草茶”可以看当前这道题的考点；遗物在状态条里单独一排，放不下可以左右拖动，不会超出屏幕；全屏答题时（尤其开着背景皮肤）答题后的解析区可以正常上下滑动了。": "Paris Spire: boss grammar tags appear at A1/A2 and are hidden from B1 onward. Verbena tea reveals the current question’s topic. Relics have their own scrollable row. Long explanations now scroll correctly in fullscreen mode.",
"巴黎塔尖：两个事件按歌词修正了标题——「本是浪人」改为「我本浪人」，「千亿晚，亿天」改为「千忆晚，千忆天」，事件描述也跟着调整。": "Paris Spire: two event titles and their descriptions were corrected to match the lyrics that inspired them.",
"小行星与玫瑰": "Asteroid & Rose",
"深夜蓝星空下，玫瑰从紫色岩面生长，远处铺开暖金沙丘与环形星球；搭配星光日历、像素玫瑰和流星边框。": "Under a midnight-blue sky, a rose grows from violet rock beside warm golden dunes and a distant ringed planet, with a starlight activity calendar, pixel rose and shooting-star borders.",
"商店新增皮肤「小行星与玫瑰」（星空、小行星上的一朵玫瑰、沙丘和流星，1500 金币）；巴黎塔尖新增事件「女皇的新衣」：巴黎的服装店，买件新外套换一面护盾，或者校对法语吊牌赚金币。": "New shop skin: Asteroid & Rose, for 1,500 coins. Paris Spire adds a clothing-shop event: buy a coat for a shield or proofread French labels to earn coins.",
"单词闯关的进度现在跟着账号同步：在手机上做到一半，换到 iPad 或电脑登录同一个账号，点这一关也能接着做；在一台设备上做完或“从头开始本关”，其他设备上的存档也会一起清掉。": "Vocabulary level progress now syncs with your account. Resume a level on another device; finishing or restarting also clears that save on your other devices.",
"去做 →": "Go →",
"去做这个任务": "Do this quest",
"${x.text}，${x.v}/${x.target}，去做": "${x.text}, ${x.v}/${x.target}, go",
"每日任务的每一行都可以点了：没做完的任务旁边有“去做 →”，点一下直接跳到对应的练习（答题类任务先做今日计划，复习任务去复习到期的题，变位、背单词任务去对应的板块）。": "Each daily quest can now be opened directly. Its action takes you to the daily plan, due reviews, conjugation or vocabulary as appropriate.",
"好友页的昵称、“在排行榜上显示我”和橱窗里的明信片现在跟着账号同步：换一台设备登录，资料都还在；在任意一台设备上修改，其他设备同步后也会更新。": "Your nickname, leaderboard visibility and postcard showcase now sync with your account across devices.",
"全屏做题时（手机、iPad、电脑），题目放在选项上方的空白里上下左右居中，不再贴着顶部；动词变位题改成“不定式 →时态→ 主语 ___”的写法，比如 avoir 箭头上写着“直陈式现在时”，后面是 il ___。": "Fullscreen questions are centered in the space above the answers. Conjugation prompts show the infinitive, tense, and subject followed by a blank.",
