"不回头，往上走": "Don't look back — keep climbing",
"风中诗": "Poem on the Wind",
"一阵风从塞纳河上吹来，卷起一页写着诗的纸，停在你脚边。上面有一个词你好像认得。": "A gust from the Seine lifts a page with a poem on it and drops it at your feet. There's a word on it you think you know.",
"读一读": "Read it",
"1 道单词题：答对得一件随机遗物，答错什么也没有": "1 word question: a correct answer earns a random relic, a wrong one earns nothing",
"你读懂了这句诗": "You understood the line",
"风又把纸吹走了": "The wind blows the page away again",
"让它随风飘走": "Let it blow away",
"无意的相遇": "A Chance Encounter",
"楼梯转角，你和一个人撞了个满怀。只是无意碰到，却像早就知道会这样开始。": "At a turn in the stairs, you bump right into someone. Just an accident, yet it feels like it was always meant to begin this way.",
"一起走一段": "Walk together for a while",
"有人同行，脚步轻了": "With company, your steps feel lighter",
"点点头，继续独行": "Nod and walk on alone",
"像清风一样自由：得 30 金币": "Free as the breeze: get 30 coins",
"你还是喜欢一个人走": "You still prefer to walk alone",
"完全无需语言": "No Words Needed",
"对方什么也没说，你却全都明白了。这份默契会陪你走过下一段路。": "They say nothing, yet you understand everything. This unspoken bond will stay with you for the next stretch.",
"收下这份默契": "Accept the bond",
"回 1 颗心，并得到一面护盾（下次答错不扣心）": "Restore 1 heart and get a shield (your next wrong answer costs no heart)",
"一切尽在不言中": "Everything goes without saying",
"一面护盾": "A shield",
"灵魂如火": "A Soul Like Fire",
"塔上的风很冷，心里却像有一团火在烧。要不要把这团火交出去，换一件东西？": "The wind atop the tower is cold, but a fire burns in your heart. Will you give up this fire in exchange for something?",
"燃烧 1 颗心": "Burn 1 heart",
"失去 1 颗心的上限，换一件随机遗物": "Lose 1 max heart for a random relic",
"火光一闪": "A flash of flame",
"心的上限 -1": "Max hearts -1",
"让火继续烧着": "Let the fire keep burning",
"千忆晚，千忆天": "A Thousand Nights, a Thousand Days to Remember",
"从前像风声一样飘泊，现在只想停下来，把每一晚、每一天都记住。塔尖下的小咖啡馆还亮着灯，老板说：今晚和明天，都可以留下。": "You used to drift like the sound of the wind; now you just want to stop and remember every night and every day. The little café beneath the spire still has its lights on, and the owner says: tonight and tomorrow, you're welcome to stay.",
"留下来": "Stay",
"心回满，但身上的金币全部花光": "Hearts fully restored, but you spend all your coins",
"今夜，明天": "Tonight, tomorrow",
"花掉 ${g} 金币": "Spent ${g} coins",
"道一声晚安，继续上路": "Say good night and move on",
"不必攀登巴黎塔尖": "No Need to Climb the Paris Spire",
"风很大，台阶还很长。有人在楼梯拐角对你说：不必攀登巴黎塔尖，诗一般的风光已经在眼前了——要是想去，电梯就在旁边，可以直接到塔尖去见守护者。只是这一路上的宝箱、商人和咖啡馆，就都错过了。": "The wind is strong and the stairs go on and on. Someone at a turn in the staircase tells you: no need to climb the Paris Spire — the poetic view is already before you. If you want to go, the elevator is right here and will take you straight to the spire to face the guardian. But you'll miss all the chests, merchants and cafés along the way.",
"坐电梯，直接去塔尖": "Take the elevator to the spire",
"跳过这一层剩下的路，马上开始 Boss 战": "Skip the rest of this floor and start the Boss battle now",
"电梯门打开了：塔尖到了": "The elevator doors open: you've reached the spire",
"还是一步一步爬上去": "Climb it step by step after all",
"继续走这一层的地图": "Keep exploring this floor's map",
