"打开金币、连对 combo、每日任务和宝箱、商店道具和外观，以及“游戏”模块（单词闯关、环法之旅、巴黎塔尖）。之后可以在设置里随时开关。": "Turns on coins, combo streaks, daily quests and chests, shop items and cosmetics, and the Games module (Word levels, Tour de France, Paris Spire). You can switch it on or off in Settings later.",
