"界面、题目解析、知识点卡片、巴黎塔尖事件和 Boss 题都换成英文；英文模式下答对得到的金币翻倍。": "Interface, explanations, knowledge cards, Paris Spire events and boss questions in English; coins from correct answers are doubled in English mode.",
"错题本": "Mistake book",
"学习进度页最上面的做题日历：一年里每天做了多少题、连续天数，点格子看当天明细，还能设每日提醒。": "The practice calendar at the top of Progress: how many questions you did each day of the year, your streak, tap a day for details, plus daily reminders.",
"学习进度页的错题本：所有答错过的题，按轮次、章节或标签筛选，一键重做错题。": "The mistake book in Progress: every question you got wrong, filterable by round, chapter or tag, with one-tap redo.",
